hadiths[135]{hadithnumber,text}:
"608","Muhammad bin Salaam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Ulayya ne humein khabar di, Abdul Aziz bin Suhaib se, Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dua kare to use chahiye ke dua mein azm ke saath mange aur yun na kahe: Ae Allah agar Tu chahe to mujhe ata farma, pas beshak Allah ke liye koi zabardasti karne wala nahin hai."
"609","Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Fulaih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Nuaym se aur woh Wahb hain, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Ibn Umar aur Hazrat Ibn al-Zubair ko dekha ke woh dua kar rahe thay, apni dono hatheliyon ko chehre par pher rahe thay."
"610","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Ikrima se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, us ne daawa kiya ke us ne ise un se suna tha, ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha ke Aap dono haath uthaye hue dua kar rahe thay aur farma rahe thay: Main to sirf ek bashar hun pas Tu mujhe saza na de, momineen mein se jo mard bhi ho jise maine takleef pahunchayi ho ya use bura bhala kaha ho to Tu mujhe us ke baare mein saza na de."
"611","Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Araj se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne farmaya: Tufail bin Amr al-Dausi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaye to kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, beshak Daus ne nafarmani ki hai aur inkar kiya hai, pas Allah se un ke khilaf dua kijiye, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne qible ki taraf rukh kiya aur apne dono haath uthaye, to logon ne gumaan kiya ke Aap un ke khilaf dua kar rahe hain, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah Daus ko hidayat de aur unhein le aa."
"612","Muhammad bin Salaam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Jafar ne humein khabar di, Humaid se, Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek saal barish qahat zadah ho gayi, to baaz Musalman Jumuah ke din Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf khare hue to kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, barish qahat zadah ho gayi aur zameen banjar ho gayi aur maal halak ho gaya, to Aap ne apne dono haath uthaye aur aasman mein koi badal nazar nahin aa raha tha, to Aap ne apne dono haath phaila diye hatta ke maine Aap ke baghlon ki safedi dekhi, Allah se barish talab karte hue, to hum ne Jumuah ki namaz bhi na parhi thi ke ghar ke qareeb rehne wale naujawan ko apne ghar walon ki taraf lautne ki fikr hone lagi, to musalsal ek jumuah tak barish hoti rahi, phir jab agla jumuah aaya to us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, ghar munhadam ho gaye aur sawaar rok liye gaye, to Aap Ibn Adam ke jaldi ukta jane par muskuraye aur apne haath se farmaya: Ae Allah hamare ird gird barsa aur hum par na barsa, to badal Madina se chhat gaya."
"613","Al-Salt ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrima se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, ke us ne ise un se suna tha, ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekha ke Aap dono haath uthaye hue dua kar rahe thay aur farma rahe thay: Ae Allah main to sirf ek bashar hun pas Tu mujhe saza na de, momineen mein se jo mard bhi ho jise maine takleef pahunchayi ho ya use bura bhala kaha ho to Tu mujhe us mein saza na de."
"614","Aarim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj al-Sawwaf ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Tufail bin Amr ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha: Kya aap ke liye qila aur hifazat mein raghbat hai, Daus ka qila, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne inkar kiya, us ajr ki wajah se jo Allah ne Ansar ke liye zakhira kar rakha tha, phir Tufail ne hijrat ki aur un ke saath un ki qaum ka ek mard bhi hijrat karke aaya, to woh mard beemar ho gaya to ghabra gaya ya is se milta julta koi kalima kaha, to ghisat kar ek seeng ki taraf gaya, to ek tez dhaar wala teer liya to apni gardan ki ragon ko kaat liya to mar gaya, to Tufail ne use khwab mein dekha to kaha: Tere saath kya kiya gaya, us ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf meri hijrat ki wajah se mujhe bakhsh diya gaya, unhon ne kaha: Tere dono haathon ka kya muamla hai, us ne kaha: to kaha gaya: Hum tumhari woh cheez durust nahin karenge jo tum ne apne dono haathon ki bigari hai, to Tufail ne ise Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se bayan kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah us ke dono haathon ko bhi bakhsh de, aur Aap ne apne dono haath uthaye."
"615","Abu Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Suhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, Hazrat Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam panah talab karte thay, farmate thay: Ae Allah beshak main susti se Teri panah mangta hun aur buzdili se Teri panah mangta hun aur buri umr se Teri panah mangta hun aur bakheeli se Teri panah mangta hun."
"616","Khalifa bin Khayyat ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kathir bin Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid bin al-Asamm se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke paas hun aur main us ke saath hun jab woh mujhe pukarta hai."
"617","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Zurai ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Buraida ne hum se bayan kiya, Bushair bin Kab se, Shaddad bin Aus se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Sayyid al-Istighfar hai: Ae Allah Tu mera Rabb hai Tere siwa koi mabud nahin, Tune mujhe paida kiya aur main Tera banda hun aur main apni istitaat ke mutabiq Tere ahd aur Tere waade par hun, main Teri nemat ka Tere huzur iqrar karta hun aur apne gunah ka Tere huzur iqrar karta hun, pas mujhe bakhsh de, pas beshak gunahon ko Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta, main jo kuch maine kiya us ke shar se Teri panah mangta hun, jab us ne shaam ke waqt ise kaha phir mar gaya to Jannat mein dakhil hoga, ya farmaya: Jannat walon mein se hoga, aur jab us ne subah ke waqt ise kaha phir apne usi din mein mar gaya to isi tarah hoga."
"618","Ahmad bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numair ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik bin Mighwal se, Ibn Sauqa se, Nafi se, Hazrat Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Beshak hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye majlis mein shumar karte thay: Ae mere Rabb mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par tawajjuh farma, beshak Tu hi bahut tauba qubul karne wala rehem karne wala hai, sau martaba."
"619","Muhammad bin al-Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Husain se, Hilal bin Yasaf se, Zadzan se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Chasht ki namaz parhi phir farmaya: Ae Allah mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par tawajjuh farma, beshak Tu hi bahut tauba qubul karne wala rehem karne wala hai, hatta ke Aap ne ise sau martaba kaha."
"620","Abu Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Buraida ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Bushair bin Ka'b al-Adawi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Shaddad bin Aus ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se bayan kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Sayyidul Istighfar ye hai ke banda kahe: Ae Allah, Tu mera Rabb hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin, Tune mujhe paida kiya aur main Tera banda hun, aur main Tere ahd aur Tere wade par qaim hun jahan tak taqat rakhta hun, main us shar se Teri panah chahta hun jo maine kiya, main Tere huzur Teri nemat ka iqrar karta hun aur Tere huzur apne gunah ka iqrar karta hun, pas mujhe bakhsh de, pas beshak gunahon ko Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta, Aap ne farmaya: jo isay din ke waqt yaqeen rakhte hue kahe, phir apne usi din shaam hone se pehle mar jaye to woh jannat walon mein se hai, aur jo isay raat ke waqt kahe jabke woh us par yaqeen rakhta ho, phir subah hone se pehle mar jaye to woh jannat walon mein se hai."
"621","Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murra se, Abu Burda se, maine Agharr se suna, jo Juhaina ka ek shakhs hai, woh Abdullah bin Umar se bayan kar raha tha, unhon ne kaha: maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap farmate the: Allah se tauba karo, pas beshak main har din Us se sau martaba tauba karta hun."
"622","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se, Ka'b bin Ujra se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'aqqibat hain, unka kehne wala nakam nahin hota: SubhanAllah, walhamdulillah, wa la ilaha illallah, wallahu akbar, sau martaba. Ibn Abi Unaisa aur Amr bin Qais ne isay marfu bayan kiya."
"623","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne mujh Abdullah bin Yazid se kaha: maine Abdullah bin Amr se suna, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: sab se jaldi qubul hone wali dua ghaib ka ghaib ke liye dua karna hai."
"624","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Haywa ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Shurahbil bin Sharik al-Ma'afiri ne khabar di, unhon ne Abu Abdur Rahman al-Hubuli se suna, unhon ne Sunabihi se suna, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu se suna: beshak Allah ke waste bhai ki dua qubul ki jati hai."
"625","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Abi Ghaniyya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abdul Malik bin Abi Sulaiman ne khabar di, Abu Zubair se, Safwan bin Abdullah bin Safwan se, aur unke nikah mein Darda bint Abi Darda thin, unhon ne kaha: main Sham mein un logon ke pas aya, to maine Umm Darda ko ghar mein paya, aur maine Abu Darda ko nahin paya, unhon ne kaha: kya tum is saal hajj ka irada rakhte ho, maine kaha: han, unhon ne kaha: pas hamare liye Allah se bhalai ki dua karna, pas beshak Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate the: beshak Musalman shakhs ki dua apne bhai ke liye peeth peeche qubul hoti hai, uske sar ke pas ek muwakkal farishta hota hai, jab bhi woh apne bhai ke liye bhalai ki dua karta hai to woh kehta hai: Ameen, aur tere liye bhi isi jaisa ho, unhon ne kaha: pas main Abu Darda se bazar mein mila to unhon ne bhi isi jaisa kaha, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se naql karte hue."
"626","Musa bin Ismail aur Shihab ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata bin Saib se, unke walid se, Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs ne kaha: Ae Allah, mujhe aur Muhammad ko bakhsh de, hum dono hi ko, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: beshak tune isay bahut se logon se rok diya."
"627","Jandal bin Waliq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus bin Khabbab se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap majlis mein sau martaba Allah se istighfar karte the: Ae mere Rabb, mujhe bakhsh de, aur mujh par tawajjoh farma, aur mujh par raham farma, beshak Tu hi bahut tauba qubul karne wala, nihayat raham karne wala hai."
"628","Ubaid bin Ya'ish ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ishaq se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: beshak main apne har kaam mein dua mangta hun, yahan tak ke Allah meri sawari ke chalne mein kushadgi de, yahan tak ke main us mein se woh dekhta hun jo mujhe khush karta hai."
"629","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Abdullah Abu Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhajir Abu Hasan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr bin Maimun al-Audi se, Umar se, woh un duaon mein jo woh mangte the ye kehte the: Ae Allah, mujhe nekon ke sath wafat de, aur mujhe buron mein peeche na chhor, aur mujhe achhe logon se mila de."
"630","Umar bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaqiq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah kasrat se in duaon se dua mangte the: Ae hamare Rabb, hamare darmiyan sulah farma, aur hamen Islam ke raste ki hidayat de, aur hamen andheron se nikal kar roshni ki taraf nijat de, aur hum se behayaiyon ko pher de, jo un mein se zahir hon aur jo poshida hon, aur hamare liye hamare kanon aur hamari ankhon aur hamare dilon aur hamari biwiyon aur hamari aulad mein barkat de, aur hum par tawajjoh farma, beshak Tu hi bahut tauba qubul karne wala, nihayat raham karne wala hai, aur hamen Apni nemat ka shukr karne wala bana, uski sana karne wala, uska iqrar karne wala, aur usay hum par mukammal farma."
"631","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: Anas jab apne bhai ke liye dua karte to kehte the: Allah us par nek logon ki dua ho jo na zulm karne wale hon aur na badkar hon, jo raat mein qiyam karte hain aur din mein roza rakhte hain."
"632","Ibn Numair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Abi Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Amr bin Huraith ko kehte hue suna: meri walida mujhe Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas le gaeen, pas Aap ne mere sar par haath phera aur mere liye rizq ki dua farmai."
"633","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdullah al Rumi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, Hazrat Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: un se kaha gaya: beshak aap ke bhai aap ke paas Basra se aaye hain, aur woh us din Zawiya me thay, taake aap Allah se un ke liye dua karen, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah hamen bakhsh de aur hum par raham farma aur hamen duniya me bhalai ata farma aur aakhirat me bhalai ata farma aur hamen aag ke azab se bacha, pas unhon ne un se mazeed mangi, to unhon ne isi tarah kaha, pas unhon ne farmaya: agar tumhen ye ata kar diya gaya to tehqeeq tumhen duniya o aakhirat ki bhalai ata kar di gayi."
"634","Abu Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Warith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Rabia Sinan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Anas bin Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek tehni pakdi phir us ko jhatka to woh na jhadi, phir us ko jhatka to woh na jhadi, phir us ko jhatka to woh jhad gayi, Aap ne farmaya: beshak Subhan Allah aur Alhamdulillah aur La ilaha illallah gunahon ko is tarah jhad dete hain jaise darakht apne patton ko jhadta hai."
"635","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Anas ko kehte hue suna: ek aurat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas hajat ki shikayat lekar aayi ya hajat me se kuch ki shikayat lekar, to Aap ne farmaya: kya main tumhen is se behtar cheez na bataun, tum apne sone ke waqt tees martaba tahleel karo aur taintees martaba tasbeeh karo aur chauntees martaba hamd karo, pas ye sau hain jo duniya aur jo kuch us me hai us se behtar hain."
"636","Aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jo shakhs sau martaba tahleel kare aur sau martaba tasbeeh kare aur sau martaba takbeer kahe to ye us ke liye das gardanon se behtar hai jinhen woh aazad kare aur saat qurbani ke oonton se behtar hai jinhen woh zibah kare."
"637","Pas ek aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kaun si dua afzal hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah se duniya aur aakhirat me afw o aafiyat ka sawal karo, phir woh agle din Aap ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi, kaun si dua afzal hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah se duniya aur aakhirat me afw o aafiyat ka sawal karo, pas jab tumhen duniya aur aakhirat me aafiyat de di gayi to tehqeeq tum kamyab ho gaye."
"638","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, al Jurairi se, unhon ne Abu Abdullah al Anazi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin al Samit se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Dharr se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob kalam ye hai: Allah paak hai, us ka koi shareek nahin, usi ke liye badshahat hai aur usi ke liye hamd hai, aur woh har cheez par qadir hai, gunah se bachne ki taqat aur neki ki quwwat Allah ke baghair nahin, Allah paak hai aur us ki hamd ke sath."
"639","Salt bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mehdi bin Maimun ne hum se bayan kiya, al Jurairi se, unhon ne Jabr bin Habib se, unhon ne Umm Kulthum bint Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere paas tashreef laye aur main namaz padh rahi thi aur Aap ko ek hajat thi, to main ne Aap par der kar di, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha, jame duaon aur un ke majmua ko lazim pakdo, pas jab main namaz se fariq hui to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, jame duain aur un ke majmue kya hain, Aap ne farmaya: kaho: Ae Allah beshak main Tujh se har khair ka sawal karti hun, us ke jald aane wali aur der se aane wali, jo main ne us me se jana aur jo main ne na jana, aur main Teri panah chahti hun har shar se, us ke jald aane wale aur der se aane wale se, jo main ne us me se jana aur jo main ne na jana, aur main Tujh se Jannat ka sawal karti hun aur us qaul ya amal ka jo us ke qareeb kare, aur main Teri panah chahti hun Jahannum se aur us qaul ya amal se jo us ke qareeb kare, aur main Tujh se us cheez ka sawal karti hun jo Tujh se Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mangi, aur main Teri panah chahti hun us cheez se jis se Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne panah mangi, aur jo faisla Tu mere liye kare pas us ke anjam ko hidayat bana de."
"640","Yahya bin Sulaiman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin al Harith ne mujhe khabar di, Darraj se, ke Abu al Haitham ne un se bayan kiya, Hazrat Abu Saeed al Khudri se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: jo bhi musalman aadmi ho jis ke paas sadqa na ho to use chahiye ke apni dua me ye kahe: Ae Allah Muhammad par jo Tere bande aur Tere Rasool hain darood bhej aur momin mardon aur momin auraton par aur musalman mardon aur musalman auraton par rehmat bhej, pas beshak ye us ke liye zakat hai."
"641","Muhammad bin al Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed bin Abdur Rahman se jo Saeed bin al Aas ke maula hain, unhon ne kaha: Hanzala bin Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: jo shakhs ye kahe: Ae Allah Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par darood bhej jaisa Tune Ibrahim aur Ibrahim ki aal par darood bheja, aur Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par barkat nazil farma jaisa Tune Ibrahim aur Ibrahim ki aal par barkat nazil farmai, aur Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par rehem farma jaisa Tune Ibrahim aur Ibrahim ki aal par rehem farmaya, to main qayamat ke din us ke haq me gawahi dunga aur us ki shafaat karunga."
"642","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salama bin Wardan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Anas aur Malik bin Aus bin al Hadathan se suna ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam qazae hajat ke liye bahar tashreef le gaye to Aap ne kisi ko na paya jo Aap ke peeche chale, pas Hazrat Umar bahar nikle aur ek matti ke bartan ya wuzu ke bartan ke sath Aap ke peeche gaye, pas unhon ne Aap ko ek nale me sajda karte hue paya, to woh hate aur Aap ke peeche baith gaye, yahan tak ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apna sar uthaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Umar tum ne acha kiya jab tum ne mujhe sajda karte hue paya to mujh se hat gaye, beshak Jibrail mere paas aaye aur unhon ne kaha: jo shakhs Aap par ek martaba darood bheje Allah us par das rehemten nazil farmayega aur us ke liye das darje buland karega."
"643","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus bin Abi Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Buraid bin Abi Maryam se, main ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik ko suna, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: jo shakhs mujh par ek martaba darood bheje Allah us par das rehemten nazil farmayega aur us se das khatayen door kar dega."
"644","Hamen Abdul Rahman bin Shaiba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abdullah bin Nafi al-Saigh ne khabar di, Isam bin Zaid se, aur Ibn Shaiba ne un ki khoob tareef ki, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mimbar par chadhe, phir jab pehle darje par chadhe to farmaya: Ameen, phir doosre par chadhe to farmaya: Ameen, phir teesre par chadhe to farmaya: Ameen, to logon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolallah, ham ne aap ko suna aap teen martaba Ameen farma rahe the? Farmaya: jab main pehle darje par chadha mere paas Jibril sallallahu alaihi wasallam aaye to unhon ne kaha: badbakht hai woh banda jis ne Ramazan paya, phir woh us se guzar gaya aur us ki maghfirat na hui, to main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir unhon ne kaha: badbakht hai woh banda jis ne apne waldain ya un mein se ek ko paya phir unhon ne use Jannat mein dakhil na karaya, to main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir unhon ne kaha: badbakht hai woh banda jis ke samne aap ka zikr kiya gaya aur us ne aap par durood na bheja, to main ne kaha: Ameen."
"645","Hamen Ibrahim bin Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Ismail bin Jafar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ala ne khabar di, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jo shakhs mujh par ek martaba durood bheje Allah us par das martaba rehmat bheje."
"646","Hamen Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Ibn Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya, Kasir se jo use riwayat karte hain, Waleed bin Rabah se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mimbar par chadhe to farmaya: Ameen, Ameen, Ameen, un se arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasoolallah, aap aisa nahi kiya karte the? To farmaya: mujh se Jibril ne kaha: naak khaak aalood ho us bande ki jis ne apne maa baap ya un mein se ek ko paya phir unhon ne use Jannat mein dakhil na karaya, main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir unhon ne kaha: naak khaak aalood ho us bande ki jis par Ramazan dakhil hua aur us ki maghfirat na hui, to main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir unhon ne kaha: naak khaak aalood ho us shakhs ki jis ke samne aap ka zikr kiya gaya phir us ne aap par durood na bheja, to main ne kaha: Ameen."
"647","Hamen Ali ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman jo Aal e Talha ke maula hain ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Kuraib Abu Rushdain se suna, Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, Hazrat Juwairiya bint al-Haris bin Abi Zirrar se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke paas se bahar tashreef le gaye, aur un ka naam Barra tha, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam badal diya, to un ka naam Juwairiya rakha, phir aap bahar tashreef le gaye aur napasand farmaya ke dakhil hon aur un ka naam Barra ho, phir din chadhne ke baad un ki taraf wapas tashreef laye jabke woh apni majlis mein thin, to farmaya: kya tum ab tak apni majlis mein ho? Tahqeeq main ne tumhare baad chaar kalime teen martaba kahe hain, agar un ka tumhare kalimon se wazan kiya jaye to woh un se bhari rahen: Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi us ki makhlooq ki tadad ke barabar aur us ki zaat ki raza ke barabar aur us ke arsh ke wazan ke barabar aur us ke kalimat ki siyahi ya madde ke barabar."
"648","Hamen Ibn Salam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu Muawiya ne bayan kiya, Amash se, Abu Salih se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah se Jahannam ki panah mango, Allah se qabr ke azab ki panah mango, Allah se Masih Dajjal ke fitne ki panah mango, Allah se zindagi aur maut ke fitne ki panah mango."
"649","Hamen Hasan bin Rabi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Ibn Idris ne bayan kiya, Lais se, Muharib bin Disar se, Hazrat Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmaya karte the: Ae Allah meri samaat aur basarat durust farma de aur un donon ko mera waris bana de aur jis ne mujh par zulm kiya us ke muqable mein meri nusrat farma aur mujhe us se mera badla dikha."
"650","Hamen Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Hammad ne bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salama se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmaya karte the: Ae Allah mujhe meri samaat aur basarat se faida pahuncha aur un donon ko mera waris bana aur mere dushman ke muqable mein meri nusrat farma aur mujhe us se mera badla dikha."
"651","Hamen Ali bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Marwan bin Muawiya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Saad bin Tariq bin Ashyam al-Ashjai ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: ham Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf subah jaya karte the, to koi mard aata aur koi aurat aati to arz karti: Ya Rasoolallah main jab namaz padhun to kya kahun? To aap farmate: kaho: Ae Allah mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par rehem farma aur mujhe hidayat de aur mujhe rizq ata farma, to tahqeeq ye kalime tere liye teri duniya aur aakhirat jama kar chuke."
"652","Hamen Qutaiba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Lais ne bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abi Habib se, Abul Hasan jo Hazrat Umm Qais bint Mihsan ke maula hain se, Hazrat Umm Qais se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya woh baat jo unhon ne kahi thi: us ki umar lambi ho, aur ham nahi jante kisi aurat ko itni lambi umar di gayi jitni unhein di gayi."
"653","Hamen Arim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Saeed bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, Sinan se, unhon ne kaha: hamen Hazrat Anas ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam hamare paas ahl e bait ke paas tashreef laya karte the, to ek din tashreef laye to hamare liye dua farmayi, to Hazrat Umm Sulaim ne arz kiya: aap ka chhota khadim kya aap us ke liye dua nahi farmayenge? Farmaya: Ae Allah us ke maal aur aulaad ko zyada farma aur us ki zindagi lambi farma aur use bakhsh de."
"654","Hamen Abul Yaman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Shuaib ne bayan kiya, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Ubaid jo Abdur Rahman ke maula the ne khabar di, aur woh qurra aur ahl e fiqh mein se the, ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se suna ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum mein se har ek ki dua qabool ki jati hai jab tak woh jaldi na kare, yun kahe: main ne dua ki phir meri dua qabool na hui."
"655","Hamen Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Muawiya ne bayan kiya ke unhein Rabia bin Yazid ne bayan kiya, Abu Idris se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: tum mein se har ek ki dua qabool ki jati hai jab tak woh gunah ya qata rehmi ki dua na kare ya jaldi na kare phir kahe: main ne dua ki to main nahi dekhta ke meri dua qabool ki jati hai, phir dua chhod de."
"656","Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Had ne mujh se bayan kiya, Amr bin Shuaib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Ae Allah main susti aur qarze ke bojh se teri panah mangta hun, aur Masih Dajjal ke fitne se teri panah mangta hun, aur aag ke azab se teri panah mangta hun."
"657","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ziyad ne humein khabar di, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Allah ki panah manga karte the zindagi aur maut ke shar se, aur qabr ke azab se, aur Masih Dajjal ke shar se."
"658","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan bin Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Malih Subaih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah se sawal nahin karta Allah us par ghazabnak hota hai."
"659","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Aziz se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum Allah se dua mango to dua mein pukhtagi ikhtiyar karo, aur tum mein se koi hargiz yeh na kahe: Agar Tu chahe to mujhe ata farma, kyunke Allah se koi zabardasti karne wala nahin hai."
"660","Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Abi az-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aban bin Usman se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Usman ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jis ne har din ki subah aur har raat ki shaam ko teen teen martaba yeh kaha: Allah ke naam ke sath jis ke naam ke sath zameen mein aur na aasman mein koi cheez nuqsan nahin deti aur Wohi khoob sunne wala khoob janne wala hai, use koi cheez nuqsan nahin pahunchayegi."
"661","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, Sahl bin Sad se, unhon ne kaha: Do ghariyan aisi hain jin ke liye aasman ke darwaze khole jate hain, aur bahut kam hi koi dua mangne wala hota hai jis ki dua us par radd ki jaye: jab nidai namaz ka waqt hazir ho, aur Allah ke raste mein saf bandhe."
"662","Amr bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Said se, Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, Luluah se, Abu Sirmah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmaya karte the: Ae Allah main Tujh se apni beniyazi aur apne maula ki beniyazi ka sawal karta hun."
"663","Yahya bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sad bin Aus ne hum se bayan kiya, Bilal bin Yahya se, Shutair bin Shakal bin Humaid se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool mujhe koi dua sikhaiye jis se main nafa uthaun, Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah mujhe mere kaan aur meri aankh aur meri zaban aur mere dil ke shar se afiyat de, aur meri mani ke shar se."
"664","Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murra se, Abdullah bin al-Haris se, Talq bin Qais se, Abdullah bin Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmaya karte the: Ae Allah meri madad farma aur mere muqabil madad na farma, aur mujhe nusrat de aur mere muqabil nusrat na de, aur mere liye hidayat aasan farma."
"665","Abu Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Amr bin Murra ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah bin al-Haris ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Talq bin Qais ko suna, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko is dua ke sath dua mangte hue suna: Ae mere Rab meri madad farma aur mere muqabil madad na farma, aur mujhe nusrat de aur mere muqabil nusrat na de, aur mere haq mein tadbeer farma aur mere khilaf tadbeer na farma, aur mere liye hidayat aasan farma, aur jo mujh par zyadati kare us ke muqabil meri nusrat farma. Ae mere Rab mujhe apna shukr guzar bana, apna zikr karne wala bana, apne se darne wala bana, apna farmabardar bana, apne huzur jhukne wala bana, aah o zari karne wala teri taraf ruju karne wala bana, meri tauba qubul farma, mera gunah dho de, meri dua qubul farma, meri dalil qaim rakh, mere dil ko hidayat de, meri zuban durust rakh, aur mere dil ka keena nikal de."
"666","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Ziyad se, Muhammad bin Kab al-Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ne minbar par kaha: Beshak jo kuch Tune ata kiya use koi rokne wala nahin, aur jise Allah ne rok liya use koi dene wala nahin, aur kisi daulatmand ko Tere samne us ki daulat faida nahin deti. Aur jis ke sath Allah bhalai ka irada karta hai use deen mein samajh ata karta hai, maine in kalimon ko Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se in lakriyon par suna."
"667","Muhammad bin al-Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haisam bin Jamil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Husain se, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Abi Sufyan ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Sab se pukhta dua yeh hai ke tu kahe: Ae Allah Tu mera Rab hai, aur main Tera banda hun, maine apni jaan par zulm kiya, aur apne gunah ka iqrar kiya, Tere siwa gunahon ko koi nahin bakhshta, Ae mere Rab mujhe bakhsh de."
"668","Yahya bin Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Qatan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Salama yani Abdul Aziz se, Qudama bin Musa se, Abu Saleh se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam dua farmate the: Ae Allah mere deen ko mere liye durust farma jo mere kaam ki hifazat hai, aur meri duniya ko mere liye durust farma jis mein mera guzara hai, aur maut ko mere liye har burai se rehmat bana de, ya jaisa unhon ne farmaya."
"669","Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sumayy ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Saleh se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bala ki sakhti se, badbakhti ke aa lene se, bure faisle se aur dushmanon ki khushi se panah mangte the."
"670","Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Israel se, Abu Ishaq se, Amr bin Maimun se, Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam paanch cheezon se panah mangte the: susti se, bukhl se, burhape ki burai se, seene ke fitne se aur qabr ke azab se."
"671","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Motamir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne apne walid se suna, unhon ne kaha: main ne Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate the: Ae Allah main aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur intehai burhape se teri panah mangta hun, aur zindagi aur maut ke fitne se teri panah mangta hun, aur qabr ke azab se teri panah mangta hun."
"672","Makki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Saeed bin Abi Hind ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr bin Abi Amr se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Ae Allah main fikr aur gham se, aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur bukhl se, qarz ke bojh se aur logon ke ghalbe se teri panah mangta hun."
"673","Abdullah bin Abdul Wahhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Haris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman Masudi ne hum se bayan kiya, Alqama bin Marsad se, Abu Rabi se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki dua mein se tha: Ae Allah jo main ne aage bheja aur jo peeche chhora use bakhsh de, aur jo main ne chhupaya aur jo zahir kiya, aur wo jo Tu mujh se zyada janta hai, beshak Tu hi aage karne wala aur peeche karne wala hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"674","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne humein khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam dua farmate the: Ae Allah main Tujh se hidayat aur pakdamani aur ghina mangta hun, aur hamare sathiyon ne Amr se wa al tuqa kaha."
"675","Bayan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jureiri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sumama bin Hazn se, unhon ne kaha: main ne ek buzurg ko buland awaz se pukarte hue suna: Ae Allah main us shar se teri panah mangta hun jis mein koi cheez milti nahin, main ne kaha: ye buzurg kaun hain, kaha gaya: Abu Darda hain."
"676","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Israel ne hum se bayan kiya, Majzaa se, Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate the: Ae Allah mujhe barf aur ole aur thande pani se paak farma jaise maila kapra mail se paak kiya jata hai, phir farmate: Ae Allah ae hamare Rab Tere hi liye hamd hai aasman bhar aur zameen bhar aur us ke baad jo cheez Tu chahe us ke bhar."
"677","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam kasrat se is dua se dua mangte the: Ae Allah humein duniya mein bhalai ata farma aur aakhirat mein bhalai ata farma aur humein aag ke azab se bacha."
"678","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad yani Ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha se, Saeed bin Yasar se, Abu Huraira se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate the: Ae Allah main faqr aur kami aur zillat se teri panah mangta hun, aur teri panah mangta hun is se ke main zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kiya jaye."
"679","Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Motamir ne hum se bayan kiya, Laith se, Sabit bin Ajlan se, Abu Abdur Rahman se, Abu Umama se, unhon ne kaha: hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas the to unhon ne bohat si dua mangi jise hum yaad na rakh sake, to hum ne kaha: aap ne aisi dua mangi jise hum yaad nahin rakh sake, to unhon ne farmaya: main tumhein aisi cheez bataunga jo tumhare liye wo sab jama kar de: Ae Allah hum Tujh se us mein se mangte hain jo Tere Nabi Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Tujh se manga, aur hum Tujh se us se panah mangte hain jis se Tere Nabi Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Teri panah mangi, Ae Allah Tu hi madad dene wala hai aur Tujh hi tak pahunchana hai, aur Allah ke baghair na koi bachao hai na taqat, ya jaisa unhon ne farmaya."
"680","Yahya bin Bukair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid bin al-Had se, Amr bin Shuaib se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Ae Allah beshak main Masih Dajjal ke fitne se teri panah mangta hun, aur teri panah mangta hun aag ke fitne se."
"681","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, Nusair bin Abi al-Ashath se, Ata bin as-Saib se, Saeed se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ibn Abbas kaha karte the: Ae Allah jo tune mujhe rizq diya hai us par mujhe qanaat de, aur us me mere liye barkat de, aur har ghaib hone wali cheez ke badle mujhe khair ke sath ata farma."
"682","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Aziz se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki aksar dua thi: Ae Allah hamen duniya me bhalai ata farma, aur akhirat me bhalai ata farma, aur hamen aag ke azab se bacha."
"683","Hasan bin ar-Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abul Ahwas ne hum se bayan kiya, Amash se, Abu Sufyan aur Yazid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam kasrat se ye farmaya karte the: Ae Allah ae dilon ko pherne wale, mere dil ko apne deen par sabit rakh."
"684","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: qabila Aslam ke ek shakhs jise Majzaa kaha jata hai ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se suna, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ye dua farmaya karte the: Ae Allah tere hi liye hamd hai aasmanon ke bharne ke barabar aur zameen ke bharne ke barabar, aur us ke bharne ke barabar jo tu is ke baad jis cheez ko chahe, Ae Allah mujhe ole aur barf aur thande pani se paak farma, Ae Allah mujhe gunahon se paak farma, aur mujhe aise saaf farma jaise safed kapda mail se saaf kiya jata hai."
"685","Abdul Ghaffar bin Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yaqub bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa bin Uqba se, Abdullah bin Dinar se, Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki duaon me se thi: Ae Allah beshak main teri panah mangta hun teri nemat ke zawal se, aur teri afiyat ke badal jane se, aur teri achanak pakad se, aur teri tamam narazgi se."
"686","Khallad bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Miqdam bin Shuraih bin Hani se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab aasman ke kinaron me se kisi kinare par ubharta hua badal dekhte to apna kaam chhor dete, agarche namaz me hote, phir us ki taraf mutawajjeh hote, phir agar Allah use hata deta to Allah ki hamd karte, aur agar barish hoti to farmate: Ae Allah musladhar nafa dene wali barish barsa."
"687","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail se, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Hazrat Khabbab ke paas aya jabke unhon ne saat martaba dagh lagwaya tha, aur unhon ne kaha: agar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hamen maut ki dua mangne se mana na farmaya hota to main us ki dua mangta."
"688","Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik bin as-Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Ibn Abi Musa se, un ke walid se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai ke Aap is dua se dua farmaya karte the: Ae mere Rab meri khata aur meri jahalat, aur mere tamam muamle me meri zyadti ko bakhsh de, aur use bhi jo tu mujh se zyada janta hai, Ae Allah meri har khata ko bakhsh de, aur mere iradatan kiye ko aur meri jahalat ko aur mere mazaq ko, aur ye sab mere pas hai. Ae Allah bakhsh de jo main ne aage bheja aur jo pichhe chhora, aur jo main ne chhupaya aur jo main ne zahir kiya, tu hi aage karne wala hai aur tu hi pichhe karne wala hai, aur tu har cheez par qudrat rakhne wala hai."
"689","Ibn al-Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Abdul Majid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Israil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr bin Abi Musa aur Abu Burda se, mera khayal hai ke Hazrat Abu Musa Ashari se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai ke Aap dua farmaya karte the: Ae Allah meri khata aur meri jahalat aur mere muamle me meri zyadti ko bakhsh de, aur use bhi jo tu mujh se zyada janta hai, Ae Allah mere mazaq aur mere jidd, aur meri khata aur mere iradatan kiye ko bakhsh de, aur ye sab mere pas hai."
"690","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Haiwah se, unhon ne kaha: Uqba bin Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Abdur Rahman Hubuli se suna, Sunabihi se, Hazrat Muadh bin Jabal se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mera hath pakda phir farmaya: Ae Muadh, main ne kaha: hazir hun, unhon ne farmaya: beshak main tum se mohabbat karta hun, main ne kaha: aur main bhi Allah ki qasam aap se mohabbat karta hun, unhon ne farmaya: kya main tumhen aise kalimat na sikhaun jo tum har namaz ke pichhe kaha karo, main ne kaha: ji han, unhon ne farmaya: kaho: Ae Allah apne zikr par aur apne shukr par aur apni achhi ibadat par meri madad farma."
"691","Musaddad aur Khalifa ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Bishr bin al-Mufaddal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jurairi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abul Ward se, Abu Muhammad Hadrami se, Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas ek shakhs ne kaha: tamam tareef Allah ke liye bahut zyada pakeezah barkat wali hamd hai. To Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: is kalime wala kaun hai, to wo khamosh raha, aur us ne samjha ke wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf se kisi aisi cheez par ja para hai jise Aap ne napasand farmaya, to Aap ne farmaya: wo kaun hai, to us ne sawab ke siwa kuchh na kaha, to ek shakhs ne kaha: main hun, us se khair ki ummid rakhta hun, to Aap ne farmaya: qasam us zat ki jis ke hath me meri jaan hai, main ne terah farishton ko dekha ke kaun un me se use Allah azza wa jalla ki taraf pehle uthata hai, wo is me ek dusre se sabqat le ja rahe the."
"692","Abu al-Numan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Suhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Hazrat Anas ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab baitul khala me dakhil hone ka irada farmate to farmate: Ae Allah, beshak main teri panah mangta hun khabees mardon aur khabees auraton se."
"693","Malik bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Israeel ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yusuf bin Abi Burda se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab baitul khala se bahar tashreef late to farmate: teri maghfirat chahta hun."
"694","Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bakr bin Sulaim al-Sawwaf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Humaid bin Ziyad al-Kharrat ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Kuraib se jo Ibn Abbas ke azaad karda ghulam hain, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hazrat Ibn Abbas ne bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam hamen ye dua is tarah sikhate the jis tarah hamen Quran ki surat sikhate the: main teri panah mangta hun Jahannam ke azab se, aur main teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azab se, aur main teri panah mangta hun Masih Dajjal ke fitne se, aur main teri panah mangta hun zindagi aur maut ke fitne se, aur main teri panah mangta hun qabr ke fitne se."
"695","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ibn Mahdi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Sufyan se, unhon ne Salama bin Kuhail se, unhon ne Kuraib se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: main Maimuna ke han raat raha, pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam khade hue aur apni hajat ko gaye, pas apna chehra aur apne hath dhoye phir so gaye, phir khade hue aur mashkize ke pas aaye pas us ke bandhan ko khola, phir wuzu kiya aisa wuzu jo do wuzuon ke darmiyan tha, na bahut zyada pani bahaya aur khoob ada kiya, pas namaz padhi, pas main khada hua aur angdai li is na pasand karte hue ke wo dekhen ke main un ki nigrani kar raha tha, pas main ne wuzu kiya, pas wo namaz padhne khade hue, pas main un ke baen taraf khada hua, pas unhon ne mera kaan pakda aur mujhe apne daen taraf pher diya, pas un ki raat ki namaz terah rakaton me mukammal hui, phir wo let gaye pas so gaye yahan tak ke kharrate lene lage, aur jab wo sote the to kharrate lete the, pas Bilal ne unhen namaz ki ittila di, pas unhon ne namaz padhi aur wuzu na kiya, aur un ki dua me tha: Ae Allah, mere dil me noor bana de, aur meri samaat me noor bana de, aur mere daen taraf noor bana de, aur mere baen taraf noor bana de, aur mere upar noor bana de, aur mere neeche noor bana de, aur mere aage noor bana de, aur mere peeche noor bana de, aur mere liye noor ko bahut bada kar de."
"696","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdul Majid bin Suhail bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Yahya bin Abbad Abu Hubaira se, unhon ne Saeed bin Jubair se, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab raat me khade hote, pas namaz padhte pas apni namaz poori karte, Allah ki sana bayan karte us ke sath jo us ke layaq hai, phir un ke aakhri kalam me se hota: Ae Allah, mere liye mere dil me noor bana de, aur mere liye meri samaat me noor bana de, aur mere liye meri basarat me noor bana de, aur mere liye mere daen taraf noor bana de, aur baen taraf se noor, aur mere liye mere samne se noor bana de, aur peeche se noor, aur mujhe noor zyada de, aur mujhe noor zyada de, aur mujhe noor zyada de."
"697","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Malik ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu al-Zubair se, unhon ne Taous al-Yamani se, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas se: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab raat ke darmiyan me namaz ke liye khade hote to farmate: Ae Allah, tere hi liye sab tareef hai, tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo un me hain un ka noor hai, aur tere hi liye sab tareef hai, tu aasmanon aur zameen ko qaim rakhne wala hai, aur tere hi liye sab tareef hai, tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo un me hain un ka Rab hai, tu haq hai, aur tera wada haq hai, aur teri mulaqat haq hai, aur Jannat haq hai, aur Jahannam haq hai, aur Qayamat haq hai. Ae Allah, tere hi liye main ne farmabardari ki, aur tujh par iman laya, aur tujh par bharosa kiya, aur teri taraf ruju kiya, aur tere sath jhagda kiya, aur teri taraf faisla le gaya, pas mujhe bakhsh de jo main ne aage bheja aur jo peeche chhoda, aur jo main ne chhupaya aur jo zahir kiya, tu mera mabud hai, tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"698","Walid bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ubaidullah bin Amr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Zaid bin Abi Unaisa se, unhon ne Yunus bin Khabbab se, unhon ne Nafi bin Jubair bin Mutim se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam dua farmate the: Ae Allah, beshak main tujh se darguzar aur aafiyat ka sawal karta hun duniya aur aakhirat me, Ae Allah, beshak main tujh se aafiyat ka sawal karta hun apne deen me aur apne ghar walon me, aur mere aib ko chhupa, aur mere khauf ko aman de, aur meri hifazat farma mere samne se, aur mere peeche se, aur mere daen se, aur mere baen se, aur mere upar se, aur main teri panah mangta hun is se ke main apne neeche se halak kiya jaun."
"699","Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Marwan bin Muawiya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Wahid bin Aiman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ubaid bin Rifaa al-Zuraqi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: jab Uhud ka din tha aur mushrik palat gaye to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: seedhe ho jao hatta ke main apne Rab azza wa jalla ki sana karun, pas wo un ke peeche safon me ho gaye, pas unhon ne farmaya: Ae Allah, tere hi liye sab tareef hai, Ae Allah, koi rokne wala nahin us ko jo tune kushada kiya, aur koi qareeb karne wala nahin us ko jo tune door kiya, aur koi door karne wala nahin us ko jo tune qareeb kiya, aur koi dene wala nahin us ko jo tune roka, aur koi rokne wala nahin us ko jo tune diya. Ae Allah, hum par apni barkaton aur apni rehmat aur apne fazl aur apne rizq se kushadgi farma, Ae Allah, beshak main tujh se hamesha rehne wali nemat ka sawal karta hun jo na badle aur na khatm ho. Ae Allah, beshak main tujh se nemat ka sawal karta hun tangdasti ke din me, aur aman ka jang ke din me, Ae Allah, main teri panah me aata hun us cheez ki burai se jo tune hamen di, aur us cheez ke shar se jo tune hum se roki. Ae Allah, iman ko humare liye mehboob bana de aur use humare dilon me muzayyan kar de, aur kufr aur fisq aur nafarmani ko humare liye na pasandida bana de, aur hamen hidayat pane walon me se bana de. Ae Allah, hamen musalman hote hue wafat de, aur hamen musalman hote hue zinda rakh, aur hamen nek logon se mila de, na ruswa hote hue aur na fitne me padte hue. Ae Allah, kafiron se jang kar jo teri rah se rokte hain, aur tere rasoolon ko jhutlate hain, aur un par apna azab aur apna dardnak azab dal de. Ae Allah, kafiron se jang kar jinhen Kitab di gayi, ae haq mabud."
"700","Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hisham ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Qatada ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu al-Aliya se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam takleef ke waqt dua farmate the: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin jo bahut azmat wala bahut hilm wala hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin jo aasmanon aur zameen ka Rab hai aur bahut azmat wale arsh ka Rab hai."
"701","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Malik bin Amr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Jalil ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Jafar bin Maimun se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakra ne bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se kaha: Ae abba jan, beshak main aap ko sunta hun aap har subah dua farmate hain: Ae Allah, mere badan me mujhe aafiyat de, Ae Allah, meri samaat me mujhe aafiyat de, Ae Allah, meri basarat me mujhe aafiyat de, tere siwa koi mabud nahin, aap use teen martaba dohrate hain jab sham karte hain, aur jab subah karte hain teen martaba, aur farmate hain: Ae Allah, beshak main kufr aur faqr se teri panah mangta hun, Ae Allah, beshak main qabr ke azab se teri panah mangta hun, tere siwa koi mabud nahin, aap use teen martaba dohrate hain jab sham karte hain, aur jab subah karte hain teen martaba, pas unhon ne farmaya: han, ae mere bete, main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko suna unhen kehte hue, aur main pasand karta hun ke un ki sunnat par chalun."
"702","Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Malik bin al-Khattab bin Ubaidullah bin Abi Bakra ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Rashid Abu Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin al-Haris se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam takleef ke waqt farmate the: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin jo bahut azmat wala bahut hilm wala hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin jo bahut azmat wale arsh ka Rab hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin jo aasmanon ka Rab hai aur zameen ka Rab hai aur izzat wale arsh ka Rab hai, Ae Allah, us ke shar ko pher de."
"703","Mutarrif bin Abdullah Abu al-Musab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdur Rahman bin Abi al-Mawal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam hamen tamam muamlon me istikhara is tarah sikhate the jis tarah Quran ki surat sikhate the: jab koi kaam ka irada kare to do rakat padhe phir kahe: Ae Allah, beshak main tere ilm se tujh se khair mangta hun, aur teri qudrat se tujh se qudrat mangta hun, aur tujh se tere bahut bade fazl ka sawal karta hun, pas beshak tu qudrat rakhta hai aur main qudrat nahin rakhta, aur tu janta hai aur main nahin janta, aur tu ghaibon ko bahut janne wala hai. Ae Allah, agar tu janta hai ke ye kaam mere liye behtar hai mere deen me, aur meri guzran me, aur mere anjam me, ya farmaya: mere muamle ke aaghaz aur anjam me, to use mere liye muqaddar farma de, aur agar tu janta hai ke ye kaam mere liye bura hai mere deen me, aur meri guzran me, aur anjam me, ya farmaya: aaghaz, mere muamle aur us ke anjam me to use mujh se pher de aur mujhe us se pher de, aur mere liye khair muqaddar farma de jahan kahin ho, phir mujhe us par raazi kar de, aur apni hajat ka naam le."
"704","Ibrahim ibn al-Mundhir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Hamza ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kaseer ibn Zaid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman ibn Kaab se riwayat karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne is masjid me, Masjid e Fath me, peer ke din aur mangal ke din aur budh ke din dua mangi, pas budh ke din do namazon ke darmiyan un ke liye qabool kiya gaya, Jabir ne kaha: Mujh par jab bhi koi ahem gussa dilane wala muamla nazil hua magar maine usi ghari ka qasd kiya, pas maine budh ke din do namazon ke darmiyan us me usi ghari me Allah se dua mangi magar maine qabooliyat ko pehchan liya."
"705","Ali ibn Khalaf ibn Khalifa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hafs ibn akhi Anas ne mujh se bayan kiya, Anas se riwayat karte hue: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath tha, pas ek shakhs ne dua mangi pas us ne kaha: Ae aasmanon ko ibteda se paida karne wale, ae Hayy, ae Qayyum, beshak main tujh se sawal karta hun, pas Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho us ne kis cheez ke sath dua mangi hai, qasam us zaat ki jis ke hath me meri jaan hai, us ne Allah se us ke us naam ke sath dua mangi hai ke jab us ke sath us se dua mangi jaye to wo qabool karta hai."
"706","Yahya ibn Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne mujhe khabar di, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Abu al-Khair se, ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha: Mujhe ek dua sikha dijiye jo main apni namaz me mangun, Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, beshak maine apni jaan par bahut zyada zulm kiya hai, aur gunahon ko tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta, pas mujhe apne paas se maghfirat ata farma, beshak Tu hi bahut bakhshne wala nihayat rehem wala hai."
"707","Muhammad ibn Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Aamash se, unhon ne kaha: Sumama ibn Uqba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Haris ibn Suwaid ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Masud ne kaha: Jab tum me se kisi par koi imam ho jis ki sarkashi ya zulm ka use khauf ho to use kehna chahiye: Ae Allah, saaton aasmanon ke Rabb, aur azeem Arsh ke Rabb, Fulan ibn Fulan se aur teri makhlooq me se us ke grohon se mere liye panah dene wala ban ja, ke un me se koi mujh par zyadati kare ya sarkashi kare, teri panah dena izzat wala hai, aur teri sana buland hai, aur tere siwa koi mabood nahi."
"708","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Minhal ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Saeed ibn Jubair ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum kisi haibat wale badshah ke paas jao, tumhe khauf ho ke wo tum par hamla karega, to kaho: Allah sab se bara hai, Allah apni tamam makhlooq se zyada zabardast hai, Allah us se zyada zabardast hai jis se main darta hun aur khauf khata hun, aur main Allah ki panah mangta hun jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi, jo saaton aasmanon ko thaame hue hai ke wo zameen par na giren magar us ke izn se, tere bande Fulan ke shar se, aur us ke lashkaron aur us ke pairon aur us ke hamnawaon ke shar se jo jinno aur insano me se hain, Ae Allah, un ke shar se mere liye panah dene wala ban ja, teri sana buland hai, aur teri panah izzat wali hai, aur tera naam barkat wala hai, aur tere siwa koi mabood nahi, teen martaba."
"709","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sukain ibn Abdul Aziz ibn Qais ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke Ibn Abbas ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jis par fikr ya gham ya takleef nazil ho ya badshah se dare, phir wo in kalimon ke sath dua mange to us ke liye qabool kiya jayega: Main tujh se sawal karta hun la ilaha illa anta ke waste se, saaton aasmanon ke Rabb, aur azeem Arsh ke Rabb, aur main tujh se sawal karta hun la ilaha illa anta ke waste se, saaton aasmanon ke Rabb, aur kareem Arsh ke Rabb, aur main tujh se sawal karta hun la ilaha illa anta ke waste se, saaton aasmanon aur saaton zameenon aur jo kuch un me hai us ke Rabb, beshak Tu har cheez par qadir hai, phir Allah se apni hajat mang."
"710","Ishaq ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu al-Mutawakkil al-Naji ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Abu Saeed al-Khudri ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat karte hue kaha: Koi musalman aisa nahi jo dua mange, jo gunah na ho aur na qata rehmi ho, magar Allah use teen me se ek ata karta hai: ya to us ki dua us ke liye jald qabool kar leta hai, ya use us ke liye aakhirat me zakheera kar deta hai, ya us se usi ke misl burai ko door kar deta hai, unhon ne kaha: Tab to hum kasrat karenge, Aap ne farmaya: Allah zyada dene wala hai."
"711","Ibn Shaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Fudaik ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah ibn Mauhab ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne chacha Ubaidullah se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Koi momin aisa nahi jo apna chehra Allah ki taraf uthaye, us se koi hajat mange, magar Allah use wo ata karta hai, ya to use dunya me jald ata kar deta hai, ya use us ke liye aakhirat me zakheera kar deta hai, jab tak wo jaldi na kare, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, us ki jaldi kya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Wo kehta hai: Maine dua mangi aur dua mangi, aur main nahi dekhta ke meri dua qabool ki gayi."
"712","Amr ibn Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne humen khabar di, Qatada se, Saeed ibn Abi al-Hasan se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek dua se zyada izzat wali koi cheez nahi."
"713","Khalifa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Saeed ibn Abi al-Hasan se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Ibadat me sab se buland dua hai."
"714","Abu al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Zarr se, Yusay se, Numan ibn Bashir se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak dua hi ibadat hai, phir Aap ne parha: Mujhe pukaro main tumhare liye qabool karunga."
"715","Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mubarak ibn Hassan se, Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se pucha gaya: Kaunsi ibadat afzal hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi ka apne liye dua mangna."
"716","Abbas Narsi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Basra walon me se ek shakhs ne khabar di, us ne kaha: main ne Maqil bin Yasar ko kehte hue suna: main Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ke sath Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr, tum me shirk cheenti ke rengne se bhi zyada poshida hai, to Abu Bakr ne kaha: aur shirk kya hai siwae is ke ke jo Allah ke sath koi doosra mabood banae, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai Us Zaat ki jis ke hath me meri jaan hai, shirk cheenti ke rengne se bhi zyada poshida hai, kya main tumhe aisi cheez na bataun ke jab tum use kaho to tum se us ka thora aur zyada door ho jae, unhon ne kaha: kaho: Ae Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun is se ke main Tere sath shirk karun jabke main janta hun, aur Tujh se maghfirat mangta hun us ke liye jo main nahi janta."
"717","Khalifa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musanna jo Ibn Said hain unhon ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab tez hawa chalti to farmate: Ae Allah, main Tujh se us bhalai ka sawal karta hun jo us ke sath bheji gai hai, aur Teri panah mangta hun us burai se jo us ke sath bheji gai hai."
"718","Ahmad bin Abi Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mughira bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid se, Hazrat Salama se, unhon ne kaha: jab hawa tez ho jati to wo kehte: Ae Allah, phal lane wali bana, banjh na bana."
"719","Ibn Abi Shaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asbat ne hum se bayan kiya, Amash se, Habib bin Abi Sabit se, Said bin Abdur Rahman bin Abza se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Ubayy se, unhon ne kaha: hawa ko bura na kaho, pas jab tum us me se napasandida cheez dekho to kaho: Ae Allah, beshak hum Tujh se is hawa ki bhalai mangte hain, aur us bhalai ka jo us me hai, aur us bhalai ka jo us ke sath bheji gai hai, aur Teri panah mangte hain is hawa ke shar se, aur us shar se jo us me hai, aur us shar se jo us ke sath bheja gaya hai."
"720","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Auzai se, unhon ne kaha: Zuhri ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit Zuraqi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: hawa Allah ki rahat me se hai, rehmat aur azab lekar aati hai, pas use bura na kaho, lekin Allah se us ki bhalai mango, aur Allah ki panah mango us ke shar se."
"721","Mualla bin Asad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid bin Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Matar ne mujh se bayan kiya ke us ne Salim bin Abdullah ko suna, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab garaj aur bijliyon ko sunte to farmate: Ae Allah, hume Apni sakht awaz se qatl na kar, aur hume Apne azab se halak na kar, aur is se pehle hume aafiyat de."
"722","Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hakam ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrima ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Hazrat Ibn Abbas jab garaj ki awaz sunte to kehte: Paak hai Wo Zaat jis ke liye tune tasbeeh ki, unhon ne kaha: beshak raad ek farishta hai jo barish ko awaz deta hai, jaise charwaha apni bakriyon ko awaz deta hai."
"723","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik bin Anas ne mujh se bayan kiya, Amir bin Abdullah bin Zubair se, Hazrat Abdullah bin Zubair se ke wo jab garaj sunte to guftagu chhor dete aur kehte: Paak hai Wo Zaat ke garaj Us ki hamd ke sath tasbeeh karta hai aur farishte Us ke khauf se, phir kehte: beshak ye zameen walon ke liye sakht waeed hai."
"724","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Khumair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Sulaim bin Amir ko suna, Ausat bin Ismail se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ko Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki wafaat ke baad kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam pehle saal mere is maqam par khare hue, phir Abu Bakr roe, phir unhon ne kaha: tum par sach lazim hai, pas beshak wo neki ke sath hai, aur dono Jannat me hain, aur jhoot se bacho, pas beshak wo gunah ke sath hai, aur dono Aag me hain, aur Allah se aafiyat mango, pas beshak yaqeen ke baad aafiyat se behtar koi cheez nahi di gai, aur ek doosre se taalluq na todo, aur ek doosre se peeth na phero, aur ek doosre se hasad na karo, aur ek doosre se bughz na rakho, aur Allah ke bande bhai bhai ban jao."
"725","Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Jurairee se, Abul Ward se, Lajlaj se, Hazrat Muadh se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo keh raha tha: Ae Allah, beshak main Tujh se nemat ke tamam hone ka sawal karta hun, Aap ne farmaya: kya tum jante ho nemat ka tamam hona kya hai, us ne kaha: nemat ka tamam hona Jannat me dakhil hona hai, aur Aag se nijat pana hai, phir Aap ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo keh raha tha: Ae Allah, beshak main Tujh se sabr mangta hun, Aap ne farmaya: tum ne apne Rab se bala mangi hai, pas Us se aafiyat mango, aur Aap ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo keh raha tha: Ae jalal aur izzat wale, Aap ne farmaya: mang."
"726","Farwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abeeda ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abi Ziyad se, Abdullah bin Haris se, Hazrat Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib se, main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mujhe koi cheez sikhain jo main Allah se us ke zariye mangun, to unhon ne farmaya: Ae Abbas, Allah se aafiyat mang, phir main teen din thehra, phir aaya to main ne kaha: mujhe koi cheez sikhain jo main Allah se us ke zariye mangun Ae Allah ke Rasool, to unhon ne farmaya: Ae Abbas, Ae Allah ke Rasool ke chacha, Allah se duniya aur aakhirat me aafiyat mang."
"727","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, Humaid se, Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas kaha: Ae Allah, Tune mujhe maal nahi diya ke main use sadqa karun, pas mujhe aisi aazmaish me daal jo ho, ya kaha: jis me ajr ho, to Aap ne farmaya: Subhanallah, tum us ki taqat nahi rakhte, kya tum ne ye na kaha: Ae Allah, hume duniya me bhalai de, aur aakhirat me bhalai de, aur hume Aag ke azab se bacha."
"728","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: woh dakhil hue, maine Humaid se kaha kya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam the, unhon ne kaha: haan, woh ek aise shakhs par dakhil hue jo beemari ki wajah se nihayat laghar ho chuka tha, goya woh par noche hue chhote parinde ki tarah tha, Aap ne farmaya: Allah se kisi cheez ke sath dua karo ya Us se mango, to woh kehne laga: Ai Allah jo azaab Tu mujhe aakhirat me dene wala hai use duniya me hi mere liye jaldi kar de, Aap ne farmaya: SubhanAllah, tum is ki taqat nahi rakhte, ya farmaya: tum taqat nahi rakhte, kya tum ne ye kyun na kaha: Ai Allah hamein duniya me bhalai ata farma aur aakhirat me bhalai ata farma aur hamein aag ke azaab se bacha, aur Aap ne us ke liye dua farmai, to Allah azza wa jalla ne use shifa ata farmai."
"729","Umar bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Mujahid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: aadmi kehta hai: Ai Allah main bala ki sakhti se Teri panah chahta hun, phir woh khamosh ho jata hai, pas jab woh ye kahe to use kehna chahiye: magar woh bala jis me bulandi ho."
"730","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyaina ne hum se bayan kiya, Sumayy se, Abu Salih se, Abu Huraira se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bala ki sakhti se, badbakhti ke aa lene se, dushmanon ke khush hone se aur qaza ke bura hone se panah manga karte the."
"731","Abdullah bin Abi Bakr aur Muslim ne usi tarah bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nawfal bin Abi Aqrab se riwayat hai ke un ke walid ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se roze ke bare me poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: har mahine me ek din roza rakho, maine kaha: mere maa baap Aap par qurban hon, mujhe mazeed bataiye, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mazeed bataiye, mujhe mazeed bataiye, har mahine me do din roze rakho, maine kaha: mere maa baap Aap par qurban hon, mujhe mazeed bataiye, pas main apne aap ko taqatwar pata hun, to unhon ne farmaya: main apne aap ko taqatwar pata hun, main apne aap ko taqatwar pata hun, to woh khamosh ho gaye, yahan tak ke maine gumaan kiya ke woh mujhe mazeed nahi batayenge, phir unhon ne farmaya: har mahine me teen din roze rakho."
"732","Abu Maamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, Wasil maula Abi Uyaina se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Urfuta ne mujh se bayan kiya, Talha bin Nafia se, Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: hum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath the aur ek khabees badbudar hawa uthi, to Aap ne farmaya: kya tum jante ho ye kya hai, ye un logon ki hawa hai jo mominon ki gheebat karte hain."
"733","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fuzail bin Iyaz ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulaiman se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamane me ek badbudar hawa chali, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: munafiqon me se kuch logon ne musalmanon me se kuch logon ki gheebat ki hai, pas ye hawa usi wajah se bheji gayi hai."
"734","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Muawiya bin Salih ne mujh se bayan kiya, Kaseer bin Haris se, Qasim bin Abdur Rahman Shami se riwayat hai, maine Ibn Umm Abd ko kehte hue suna: jis ke samne kisi momin ki gheebat ki gayi to us ne us ki madad ki, Allah use is ke badle duniya aur aakhirat me bhalai dega, aur jis ke samne kisi momin ki gheebat ki gayi to us ne us ki madad na ki, Allah use is ke badle duniya aur aakhirat me burai dega, aur kisi shakhs ne gheebat se zyada bura luqma nahi nigla, agar us ne us ke bare me woh kaha jo woh janta hai to us ne us ki gheebat ki, aur agar us ne us ke bare me woh kaha jo woh nahi janta to us ne us par bohtan bandha."
"735","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nazar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abul Awwam Abdul Aziz bin Rabie Bahili ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zubair Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: hum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath the, to Aap do qabron par se guzre jin ke dono sathi azaab diye ja rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: ye dono kisi bari cheez me azaab nahi diye ja rahe, aur haan, raha un me se ek to woh logon ki gheebat karta tha, aur raha dusra to woh peshab se nahi bachta tha, phir Aap ne khajoor ki kachi tehni ya do tehniyan mangwain, to Aap ne unhein toda, phir Aap ne hukam diya to har tukda ek qabr par gar diya gaya, phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: khabardar raho, jab tak ye dono tar rahengi ya khushk na hongi un ke azaab me zaroor takhfeef rahegi."
"736","Ibn Numair ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Qais se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Aas apne sathiyon me se kuch logon ke sath chal rahe the, to woh ek mare hue khacchar par se guzre jo phool gaya tha, to unhon ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, tum me se kisi ka is me se khana yahan tak ke apna pet bhar le, is se behtar hai ke woh kisi musalman ka gosht khaye."
"737","Amr bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Abdur Rahim se, Zaid bin Abi Unaisa se, Abu Zubair se, Abdur Rahman bin Hadhaz Dausi se, Abu Huraira se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Maiz bin Malik Aslami aaye, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein chauthi martaba par sangsar kiya, phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke paas se guzre aur Aap ke sath Aap ke sathiyon me se kuch log the, to un me se do aadmiyon ne kaha: ye khain shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas bar bar aaya, har martaba Aap use lautate rahe, yahan tak ke use us tarah qatl kiya gaya jis tarah kutta qatl kiya jata hai, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un se khamosh rahe yahan tak ke Aap gadhe ki ek murdar lash par se guzre jis ki tang uthi hui thi, to Aap ne farmaya: is me se khao, dono ne kaha: gadhe ki murdar lash me se Ai Allah ke Rasool, Aap ne farmaya: jo tum dono ne abhi apne bhai ki aabru me se liya hai woh is se zyada hai, aur qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke hath me Muhammad ki jaan hai, beshak woh jannat ki nehron me se ek nehar me gota laga raha hai."
"738","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hanzala bin Amr Zurqi Madani ne hamein khabar di unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazra ne mujh se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Ubada bin Waleed bin Ubada bin Samit ne mujhe khabar di unhon ne kaha: main apne walid ke sath nikla aur main ek jawan ladka tha, to hum ek buzurg se mile, maine kaha: ai chacha, kis cheez ne aap ko roka ke aap apne ghulam ko ye dhari dar kambal de dein aur burda le lein, to aap par do burde hon aur us par dhari dar kambal ho, to unhon ne mere walid ki taraf tawajjuh ki aur farmaya: ye tumhara beta hai, unhon ne kaha: haan, unhon ne kaha: phir unhon ne mere sar par hath phera aur farmaya: Allah tum me barkat de, main gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: unhein us me se khilao jo tum khate ho, aur unhein us me se pehnao jo tum pehente ho, ai bhatije, duniya ke saman ka chala jana mujhe is se zyada pasand hai ke woh aakhirat ke saman me se kuch le le, maine kaha: ai mere abba, ye kaun shakhs hain, unhon ne kaha: Abul Yasar Kaab bin Amr hain."
"739","Abda ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: maine salaf ko paya, aur beshak woh apne ghar walon samet ek hi makan me hote the, to kabhi un me se kisi par mehman utarta, aur un me se kisi ki handi aag par hoti, to mehman wala apne mehman ke liye use le leta, to handi wala apni handi gum pata to kehta: handi kaun le gaya, to mehman wala kehta: hum ne use apne mehman ke liye liya hai, to handi wala kehta: Allah tumhare liye is me barkat de, ya usi tarah ka koi kalima kaha, Baqiyya ne kaha: aur Muhammad ne kaha: aur roti jab woh pakate to usi tarah hota, aur un ke darmiyan sirkande ki deewaron ke siwa kuch na hota, Baqiyya ne kaha: aur maine khud ye zamana paya: Muhammad bin Ziyad aur un ke sathiyon ka."
"740","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Abdullah bin Dawood ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Fuzail bin Ghazwan se, unhon ne Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke ek aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to Aap ne apni biwiyon ki taraf paigham bheja to unhon ne kaha hamare paas pani ke siwa kuch nahin hai to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya kaun is ko apne sath milayega ya is ki mehmaan nawazi karega to Ansar mein se ek aadmi ne kaha main phir woh use lekar apni biwi ke paas gaya aur kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke mehmaan ki izzat kar to us ne kaha hamare paas bachchon ke khane ke siwa kuch nahin hai to us ne kaha apna khana taiyar kar aur apna chiragh durust kar aur apne bachchon ko sula de jab woh raat ka khana chahen phir us ne apna khana taiyar kiya aur apna chiragh durust kiya aur apne bachchon ko sula diya phir woh khadi hui goya ke woh apna chiragh durust kar rahi hai phir us ne use bujha diya aur woh dono use yun zahir karne lage ke woh dono kha rahe hain aur woh dono raat bhar bhooke rahe phir jab subah hui to woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya yaqeenan Allah tum dono ke kaam par hansa ya farmaya hairan hua aur Allah ne nazil farmaya aur woh apne aap par dusron ko tarjeeh dete hain agarche unhen khud haajat ho aur jo apne nafs ke bukhl se bachaya gaya to wahi log kamyab hain."
"741","Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Lais ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Saeed Maqburi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Shuraih Adawi se, unhon ne kaha mere dono kaanon ne suna aur meri dono aankhon ne dekha jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne guftagu farmai to Aap ne farmaya jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne padosi ki izzat kare aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehmaan ki izzat kare us ka jaiza de kar unhon ne kaha ya Rasoolallah us ka jaiza kya hai Aap ne farmaya ek din aur ek raat hai aur mehmaan nawazi teen din hai phir jo is se peeche ho woh us par sadqa hai aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke bhalai kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"742","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Aban bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha Yahya jo Ibn Abi Kaseer hain unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya mehmaan nawazi teen din hai phir jo is ke baad ho woh sadqa hai."
